{"study_accession":"PRJNA899046","secondary_study_accession":"SRP406660","title":"Gene expression of CD14+ peripheral blood monocytes in different phases of chronic HBV infection","description":"To identify gene biomarkers for different phases of chronic HBV infection, we performed RNA-seq of CD14+ monocytes from pateints in each of the phases, which was then analyzed for differntial gene expression and validated by qRT-PCR in individual samples Overall design: CD14+ monocytes were isolated by MACS from blood of HBV patients in Immune-tolerant (IT), Immune-clearance (IC) or inactive carrier (IN) and Healthy control (HC) and RNA was isolated from these cells. 1 sample from each of IT, IC, IN and HC were sequenced as single sample, while 5 samples of IT, IC and HC were pooled repectively, hence 7 sequenced samples. Differential gene expression compared to HC was generated after RNA-seq data analysis, hence 5 total lists of differntially expressed genes, which was shortlisted for PCR validation and analyzed.","pubmed":"39049796","geo_series":"","n_samples":7,"study_labels":[],"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN31643167","study_accession":"PRJNA899046","blood_class":"blood_cells","class_from":"sample","title":"Single inactive carrier","description":"Single inactive carrier","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM6719945","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2024-08-31","attributes":[["source_name","blood"],["tissue","blood"],["cell_type","CD14+ monocytes"],["genotype","WT"],["treatment","missing"],["disease","HBV inactive"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR22215921","experiment_accession":"SRX18193850","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"Illumina NovaSeq 6000","read_count":36818364,"base_count":9560569105,"first_public":"2024-08-31","experiment_title":"Illumina NovaSeq 6000 sequencing: GSM6719945: Single inactive carrier Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"}],"labels":[],"single_cell":false},{"sample_accession":"SAMN31643168","study_accession":"P